msgctxt "96"
msgid "Oh shit... This guy doesn't mess around!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "Ahhhh! Please! No more! It hurts so bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "...Did you two set Rin up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "I...I dunno what you're talking about!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Guess you haven't learned your lessons yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"No, no, no! We have, we totally have! See, I'm the one who funneled the "
"money from our company's payroll into Rin's account..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"And Masaya's the one who gave me the account number! Said he was happy to "
"do it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Takeshita, you goddamn sellout! *sigh* Hate this asshole..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"I'm tellin' you, man, Rin thinks she's such a smartass. All she's ever done "
"is make me look incompetent at my job... Someone had to put her in her "
"place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "But now... Everything I've worked so hard for is ruined..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Save your lame excuses for the judge. Now I'm gonna give you a choice: "
"either go turn yourselves in to the police, or I can drag you there bruised "
"and battered. Up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "No need for that last option! We were just about to leave!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "...Fuck my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Huh? What the..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Who the hell is this guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Hey... He's the dude who keeps popping up with Rin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "I'll get straight to the point. Rin's been charged with embezzlement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Would you guys know anything about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Pfft... You're really that hard for her, huh? What a dumbass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Heh... Yeah, she's got him by the balls, all right. Looks like he's her "
"latest victim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"I'll say. That tramp goes through men like she goes through cheap shoes. "
"Picks 'em out at random and wears 'em out quick with that nasty attitude of "
"hers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"And once she grows tired of playing her little game? She tosses the poor "
"sap⑬no matter how serious they think it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"I mean, look at you. You think she's pretty into you, right? Well, you'll "
"just meet the same fate as every other guy she's burned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"Is that your only takeaway from the relationship you had? Maybe if you "
"decided to man up instead of shift the blame on her, Rin would've given you "
"another chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "...What did you just say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "What's wrong? Struck a nerve?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Wow. You really are deluded, aren't you? Throwing money at that skank and "
"running your mouth like that... This is some prime time comedy, man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "C'mon, Takeshita! Let's beat some sense into this dickwad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "...Did you just say Takeshita?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"What, you got a problem with my name!? Gonna make more \"take a shit\" "
"jokes!? That's it, I'm murdering this guy!"
msgstr ""

